WEBVTT

00:05:56.300 --> 00:06:00.402
And then, one gentleman
raises his hand and says, "I have."

00:06:00.711 --> 00:06:01.863
And then another,

00:06:01.887 --> 00:06:04.531
and the stories just flowed.

00:06:05.569 --> 00:06:08.607
Even this really quiet gal --

00:06:08.631 --> 00:06:12.139
she was the fiancee
of one of the expecting moms --

00:06:12.163 --> 00:06:13.996
she looks at her and she says,

00:06:14.020 --> 00:06:17.522
"See? I told you
my crying was normal too."

00:06:18.276 --> 00:06:20.204
The class connected,

00:06:20.228 --> 00:06:22.069
they validated each other,

00:06:22.093 --> 00:06:24.094
and we all walked away with a new respect

00:06:24.118 --> 00:06:26.504
for the non-pregnant partners that night.

00:06:26.528 --> 00:06:30.591
For me, that solidified my passion
to embrace those tears.